Peter Snelling (snelling@bnr.ca) wrote:
: It's always annoyed me that some characters have "intrisic" abilities
: which aren't really intrinsics which anyone else could gain.
: 
: For example:
: 
: - Priests have the ability to determine blessed/uncusred/cursed status
: - Priests and Ninja's have better kicking ability
: - Priests get a shorter prayer time out
: - Archeologists can identify any gems
: - (no others spring to mind)

Here some others from the source:
SPOILER ALERT

Valkeries, Samurai, Barbarians and Knights know weapons
Elves know all elven weapons (if TOLKIEN defined)
Elves get a +1 tohit against all orcs.
Cave-men always start out with dogs.  Wizards almost always start with
  kittens (98% chance)
Lawful Knights posses an ability known as chivalry this means:
  They lose alignment when they:
    attack a monster which is:
      not able to move
      asleep
      fleeing
    eat while already sated (gluttony)
    dig in a shop (unless you are in a pit)
Only Wizards can use a magic whistle at level 1.  All other must wait
  until till they reach 1/3 the maximum level.  The default max character
  level is 30.
Wizards get some special consideration at level 8 regarding teleporting
  that all others get at 12 (sorry couldn't quite figure out dotele())
Wizards get a better chance of writing a scroll they don't know
  Its difficult to calculate what that better chance is.
Rogues get a better chance of opening a lock with a credit card and a
  lock pick:
    20% with a credit card on a container (chest)
    25% with a lock pick on a container
    20% with a credit card on a container (chest)
    30% with a lock pick on a container
Rogues disarm a trap as a character of 3 times thier experience
Only rogues don't lose alignment for stealing from a shop
Healers are unaffected by Nurses (I could have read this wrong)
Healers don't take any damage from any poison this is regardless 
  of his/her poison resistance.
Knights and Priests can turn the undead
Tourists < MAXULEV/2 (default is 15) always suffer inflated prices (33%
  markup) This is true of anyone else wearing just a Hawaiian shirt or the
  shopkeeper is angry
Everyone desbribed in the last point also only gets 1/3 the real price
  for items sold instead of the normal 1/2.
Samurai and Priests:
  throw gold with a better range (1-3)


: 
: I think that ANY character class should be able to gain ANY intrinsic,
